
# Clangd doesn't let you specify where the config file is as a flag or disable inlay hints as a flag. Guess I just have to put a dotfile in my top level dir?
# Open issues on these since 2021...
# https://github.com/clangd/clangd/issues/845
# https://github.com/clangd/clangd/discussions/986
# The --inlay-hints=false was intentional deprecated with no replacement, why?...

# https://clangd.llvm.org/config.html#files
# Alternatively I could put this file in ~/.config/
# But that means it's not portable with the project so that's a poor option.
InlayHints:
  Enabled: No
